\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Let us with a gladsome mind 
\par Praise the Lord, for He is kind;
\par \i 
\par For His mercies aye endure,
\par Ever faithful, ever sure.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Let us blaze his name abroad,
\par For of gods He is the God :
\par 
\par \i For His mercies aye endure,
\par Ever faithful, ever sure.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. He, with all-commanding might,
\par Filled the new-made world with light :
\par 
\par \i For His mercies aye endure,
\par Ever faithful, ever sure.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. All things living he doth feed,
\par His full hand supplies their need :
\par 
\par \i For His mercies aye endure,
\par Ever faithful, ever sure.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. He His chosen race did bless 
\par In the wasteful wilderness ;
\par 
\par \i For His mercies aye endure,
\par Ever faithful, ever sure.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Let us then with gladsome mind 
\par Praise the Lord, for he is kind ;
\par \lang1033 
\par \lang2057\i For His mercies aye endure,
\par Ever faithful, ever sure.
\par \lang1033\i0\f1 
\par \cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

